      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98c707a34ff90d98",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Menghan Liu 和另外1位作者撰写的论文《VERA-8B：基于 SEC 申报文件的证据支撑型审计风险推理》的 PDF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
